# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of the platform's git config.
#
# Without this, GitHub Actions' windows-latest runner (Git for Windows,
# core.autocrlf=true by default) converts every checked-out .go file's LF
# endings to CRLF, and `gofmt -l` then flags every one of them as
# "unformatted" purely from the line-ending conversion — not from any real
# formatting problem in the source. This is what breaks go-ffi.yml's gofmt
# check step on that matrix leg specifically.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
